^TBD(290,"K122.0187C6")="Values of sys.attr.id are not registered in the value dictionary (^TBD/^TBDR). No valkey is allocated, no SingleValueUpsert is called, and no entry appears in globals @en"
^TBD(290,"K122.0187CD")="Values of sys.attr.resolvedby are not registered in the value dictionary (^TBD/^TBDR). No valkey is allocated, no SingleValueUpsert is called, and no entry appears in globals @en"
^TBD(290,"K122.0187DB")="Attribute sys.attr.notes should be differentiated from sys.attr.description or sys.attr.usage. Description explains what an entity is; usage explains when and why it should be used. @en"
^TBD(290,"K122.018817")="Do not use sys.type.val for multi-field structured values, use sys.type.cvt instead. @en"
